Z||000008||jerpro||12-07-2000||01:53 PM||||I already talked with my Ex-friend. He got a beating.<BR>I have nothing against the girl, she was nice and everything, it was simply the circumstances and how the night went.<BR>I make a vow to never go on a blind date again.<BR>I reallly felt the difference in preformance in my fiero with that girl in it.<BR>NOw i understand why drag racers take out as much as they can from the car. IT REALLY MAKES A DIFFERENCE!<BR><P>------------------<BR>Only try your best, and if you don't succeed... TRY HARDER.||||reg||1
