Z||000010||82-T/A||12-07-2000||05:10 PM||||Oh dude... that sucks.....<P>Usually I'd say.... Those Corn Fed Swedish Girls are usually hot.. but this one obviously wasn't... a little too much corn.<P>Man, that really sucks. Dude, was your friend trying to play a cruel joke on you or something? I mean.... Don't get me wrong, I really feel bad for that girl, being obese and everything (I blame her parents). But I'm sure your friend MUST have known that she was the size she was... <P>by the way, why did she start crying? Did you call her names or something?<P><P>------------------<BR>Todd Jaspers<BR>1997 Pontiac GrandAm SE<BR>1987 Pontiac Fiero SE/V6<BR>1984 Pontiac Fiero 2m4 SE<BR>http://www.ezshots.com/album.cgi?82tafiero/Apartment||||reg||1
Z||000011||Fformula88||12-07-2000||08:18 PM||||Sorry about the lousy date.... that stinks that everything went so lousy.  Give your friend a kick for me.<P>There is something worse than having the weight of a passenger in the car to kill your performance... and thats to be going on a road trip and having a car full of your girl's luggage!  About a year ago I took my g/f at the time to DC for about 5 days.  So I had a decent soft side bag and threw it in the trunk of my Probe (it's a huge hatchback trunk!) then went to pick her up.  No kidding she had two huge bags and a few other smaller things.  She had my trunk FULL!  Thats about 20 cubic feet of stuff for a five day road trip!  I didn't think we were going to make it.  About two months later my ATX died (only 11,000 miles on the car!)  I think all the wieght of that crap killed it!  At least she wasn't very big!  <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/formula2m6/FIEROSIG1.JPG">  <BR>1988 Fiero Formula||||reg||1
